THE FULLEST PLAN (8 units). The unit you write REPLACES its final unit, closing this arc:

U1: Mathematics as Pattern-Finding: An Opening Exploration
U2: Ten Sequences: Recognising and Extending Number Patterns
U3: Dot Diagrams: Seeing Why Sequences Have Their Names
U4: Hexagonal Numbers and Pictorial Powers: Extending Visual Reasoning
U5: Odd Numbers Sum to Squares: A Visual Proof and Its Extensions
U6: Cross-Sequence Connections: Triangular, Hexagonal, and Powers
U7: Shape Sequences: Rules, Extensions, and Hidden Number Patterns
U<final>: ← the unit you are writing

THE SHORTER PLANS (1). Your unit may also be served right after any of their final units, all given here in full — write to what every title map shares, in a vehicle none of these final units uses.


--- PLAN OF 5 UNITS — unit-title map ---
U1: Mathematics as Pattern-Finding: The Ten Sequences
